cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "A Closed-Form Soft Spectral Partition for Adaptive Mode Decomposition (softdamd)"
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite the paper in
  preferred-citation.
type: software
abstract: >-
  A closed-form soft spectral partition for adaptive mode
  decomposition: a normalised Lorentzian mask that replaces the
  hard Voronoi mask of DAMD, with the experiments and the
  verification suite of the paper.
